 findings under three confidence bands with the grey zone routed to a needs-a-human pile rather than acted on; it runs locally on one port with no API…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/v-modal/awesome-jev-tools/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"optional","text":"Sedum - Browser end-to-end testing: in goal mode each turn asks one Jev Choice for the next operation (click, type, done or blocked) plus a speculative target among the page's offered elements, capped at 24 requests, 18 actions and 120 s, and the test passes only when an independent verify claim clears two Nouls (holds ≥ 0.75, contradicted flagged at ≥ 0.5), since the…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/v-modal/awesome-jev-tools/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"315de2c3baf39c43fd6262f1ff4f8656838fe5849a73cd18f32a49de83532061","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/v-modal/awesome-jev-tools/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:48:15.208Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/v-modal/awesome-jev-tools/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:48:15.223Z","hash":"315de2c3baf39c43fd6262f1ff4f8656838fe5849a73cd18f32a49de83532061","originalBytes":312856,"storedBytes":312856,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["jev","decision","model","typesafe","one","code","tools","agent","sdk","choice","cli","decisions","typed","questions","frameworks","score","mcp","system","noul","routing","browser","local","claude","each","action","pipelines","against","domain","answers","where","search","every","context","per","api","evaluation","open","tool","agents","data","security","text","llm","using","through","guardrails","codex","integrations","games","asks","coding","plugin","calibrated","high-frequency","skill","confidence","models","over","structured","call","optional","python","client","answer","live","question","type","own","uses","across","before","checks","jev.","only","when","classification","judgments","plus","same","about","probabilities","request","r